{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17114","headline":"虹藏不见 · 徐敞","name":"虹藏不见","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迎冬小雪至，应节晚虹藏。\n玉气徒成象，星精不散光。\n美人初比色，飞鸟罢呈祥。\n石涧收晴影，天津失彩梁。\n霏霏空暮雨，杳杳暎残阳。\n舒卷应时令，因知圣历长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}